<title>UK: Reuters 5th ex-UK-Africa air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 5th ex-UK-Africa air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK air cargo rates to Africa per kg for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>		 June 5     April 30</p>
<p> LON-ACC	0.97	   0.95</p>
<p> LON-EBB	1.00	   1.00</p>
<p> LON-HRE	1.45	   1.43</p>
<p> LON-JNB	1.55	   1.55</p>
<p> LON-LBV	2.50	   2.42</p>
<p> LON-LOS	0.97	   0.97</p>
<p> LON-NBO	0.96	   0.93</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in sterling.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
